      "created_at": "2013-02-20T01:18:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I agree with Spiff on this one. There is a clear if-then statement that needs to be satisfied in order to destroy Pervasive Red Dust. That prerequisite condition cannot be met if any player has 0 cards to discard, so the effect is not triggered.&nbsp;</p>",
